column38:
!!! Supplementary for future readers of this comment thread !!!<p>The pragma <i>autodie</i> also spots this problem!<p>So....<p><pre><code>    use strict;
    use warnings;
    use autodie;

    our $config;
    $config->{file_paht} = "somefile";

    open my $fh, '<', $config->{file_path};
</code></pre>
Will throw an exception at <i>open()</i>.  NB. Bizarrely the error is <i>Use of uninitialized value $file in sprintf...</i> but hey the problem is still caught :)
